OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor's battle for
OL,4,Afertility funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Lancashire who had stage
OL,7,Ffour blood cancer said she is fighting
OL,8,Ffor NHS-funded fertility preservation
OL,9,Ftreatment.
OL,11,FMollie Mulheron, 28, said she was
OL,12,Funable to freeze her eggs before
OL,13,Fchemotherapy because her cancer was so
OL,14,Faggressive she needed urgent treatment.
OL,16,FAlthough she has since recovered and is
OL,17,Fcancer-free, NHS Lancashire and South
OL,18,FCumbria Integrated Care Board said it
OL,19,Fwould not fund egg freezing because she
OL,20,Fdoes not meet its eligibility criteria.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
