OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor's battle for
OL,4,Afertility funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FMollie said: "It's clearly unfair
OL,7,Fbecause the funding is there before
OL,8,Fchemotherapy, so it doesn't make sense
OL,9,Fthat it's not available now."
